<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Winterthur.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Winterthur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG, Zurich said it has issued three million American-style call warrants on Winterthur Swiss Insurance company share.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    750 CHF		   PREMIUM	11.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.65 CHF		  GEARING	8.10 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.SEP.96-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	25.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING (APPLIED) SWISS EXCHANGE	MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  757 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
